  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research to Improve Health Systems in Developing Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support research into health systems in developing countries in partnership with Wellcome Trust, the Medical Research Council and the Economic and Social Research Council. This research will improve our understanding of the most effective health interventions that contribute to reducing the burden of disease in developing countries, and how these can best be implemented to ensure that expected improvements in health are actually delivered. This will support a number of the UK Government&#x2019;s international commitments and help to advance the health related MDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
